
You should only need docker desktop installed, running "docker compose up" should download 
all the other stuff you need.

To start, run (first time might take a while):

  - docker compose up --build --detach

Once its finished, you access the site via http://localhost

You can test the backend with http://localhost/api/

And you can access the elasticsearch database with http://localhost/kibana
  - The username/password is elastic and password

To stop, run:

  - docker compose down 

